        Oversee system traffic, approve corporate hiring accounts, audit security logs, and monitor AI activity.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.75rem;">
      <a href="/admin/audit-logs" style="background: #1e293b; border: 1px solid #334155; color: #ffffff; padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem;">
        View Audit Trail
      </a>
      <a href="/admin/ai-analytics" style="background: #2563eb; color: #ffffff; padding: 0.75rem 1.4rem; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.4);">
        AI Token Usage →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

